<section id="hero" class="relative pt-20 lg:pt-24 pb-8 lg:pb-12 overflow-hidden" aria-label="Introduction">
  <div class="max-w-content mx-auto px-6 lg:px-10">
    <div class="max-w-4xl">
      <p class="label-eyebrow mb-5">Data Scientist — Data Analyst</p>
      <h1 class="section-heading mb-6 leading-[1.05]">
        Making people data understandable.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base lg:text-lg text-ink-secondary leading-relaxed mb-2 max-w-2xl">
        Computer engineering student and work psychologist focused on people analytics, applied statistics, and practical software solutions.
      </p>
      <p class="text-base lg:text-lg text-ink-secondary leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-2xl">
        I combine statistical reasoning with organizational insight to build predictive models, clear reports, and software that help teams make better workforce decisions. My work spans HR attrition modeling, feature engineering, explainability with SHAP, and end-to-end data pipelines.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-accent-green mb-8">Open to opportunities in data analysis, people analytics, and software engineering.</p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-10">
        <a href="#projects" class="btn-primary">View case studies</a>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn-secondary">Get in touch</a>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6" aria-label="Profile evidence">
        <div class="bg-surface border border-border rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-ink mb-2">People & Organizational Insight</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink-secondary leading-relaxed">HR analytics, survey design, psychometrics, and workforce dynamics — translating behavioral data into retention and performance strategies.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface border border-border rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-ink mb-2">Statistical & Analytical Reasoning</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink-secondary leading-relaxed">Predictive modeling with XGBoost, feature engineering, SHAP explainability, and hypothesis-driven exploration using Python, Pandas, and SQL.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface border border-border rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-ink mb-2">Software & Data Engineering</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink-secondary leading-relaxed">Python APIs (FastAPI), data pipelines, Docker deployments, and reproducible workflows — building systems that scale and remain understandable.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-8 mt-10 text-sm" aria-label="Verified metrics">
